sequenceDiagram
    participant API
    participant DB
    participant PUB as Outbox Publisher
    participant K as Event Broker
    participant CON as Consumer
    participant IN as Inbox

    API->>DB: TX payment update + Outbox insert
    DB-->>API: Commit
    PUB->>DB: Claim pending event
    PUB->>K: Publish eventId
    K-->>PUB: Ack
    PUB->>DB: Mark published
    K->>CON: Deliver event
    CON->>IN: Claim eventId
    alt New event
        CON->>CON: Apply business effect
    else Duplicate
        CON->>CON: No second effect
    end
